[{"id":4709050613,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGK5o9Q","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally with https://github.com/gilzoide/lua-gdextension's precompiled Linux binaries, it mostly works as expected.\r\n\r\n`master` | This PR\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"947\" height=\"266\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f4c60ecc-f1b1-4867-b5fc-0821deb229ea\" /> | <img width=\"947\" height=\"266\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/45904ce1-cc13-45bb-9422-a9445c6e3406\" />\r\n\r\nHowever, you still need to set the syntax highlighter to Standard in the script editor manually in scripts opened with this PR, even if it's already set to Standard (otherwise, it will use the built-in Standard highlighting which doesn't work on Lua). For this to apply correctly, you need to switch to any other highlighter then switch back to Standard (as re-selecting Standard won't call any code to update the highlighter).\r\n\r\nOut of curiosity, why doesn't https://github.com/gilzoide/lua-gdextension expose a Lua syntax highlighther instead of naming it Standard?\r\n\r\nBefore switching highlighter back and forth | After\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"947\" height=\"266\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/337cf06b-e2d5-40c4-a140-20f9eadb2a57\" /> | <img width=\"947\" height=\"266\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a592d1dd-4448-4844-94bd-13fe094e9b87\" />\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3449d0da-af85-427d-a895-332dcbc2eab6","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121292#pullrequestreview-4709050613","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121292","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121292#pullrequestreview-4709050613"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121292"}},"submitted_at":"2026-07-15T23:58:29Z","commit_id":"5a6eedc9675e24942210bbc42ff47f631f2a5016"}]